{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["神要保护耶路撒冷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"祸哉！那些下埃及求帮助的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是因仗赖马匹，倚靠甚多的车辆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并倚靠强壮的马兵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却不仰望以色列的圣者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不求问耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其实，耶和华有智慧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必降灾祸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并不反悔自己的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却要兴起攻击那作恶之家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又攻击那作孽帮助人的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及人不过是人，并不是 神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的马不过是血肉，并不是灵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华一伸手，那帮助人的必绊跌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那受帮助的也必跌倒，都一同灭亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和华对我如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"狮子和少壮狮子护食咆哮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是喊许多牧人来攻击它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它总不因他们的声音惊惶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不因他们的喧哗缩伏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如此，万军之耶和华","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必降临在锡安山冈上争战。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雀鸟怎样搧翅覆雏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华也要照样保护耶路撒冷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必保护拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要越门保守。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["以色列人哪，你们深深地悖逆耶和华，现今要归向他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["到那日，各人必将他金偶像银偶像，就是亲手所造、陷自己在罪中的，都抛弃了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"亚述人必倒在刀下，并非人的刀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有刀要将他吞灭，并非人的刀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必逃避这刀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的少年人必成为服苦的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的磐石必因惊吓挪去；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的首领必因大旗惊惶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是那有火在锡安、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有炉在耶路撒冷的耶和华说的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/32.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}